    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A swirling mist of corrosive black vapor from the plane of Gehenna engulfs your body. For the duration, any creature that hits you with a melee Strike takes 2d6 acid damage (no save).</p><p>As a 2-action activity (Interact + Cast a Spell), you can focus the vapor into a single corrosive burst against one creature within melee reach. Make a melee spell attack roll against that creature. On a hit, the target takes 8d6 acid damage. This attack ends the aura immediately — the vapor is entirely consumed.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The aura's retaliation damage increases by 1d6, and the focused attack damage increases by 2d6.</p>"
